@startuml tier2
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #444444
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DDFFDD
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

title Tier 2 — Payload-Driven Pareto Route Selection

start

:Operator enters 4 payload tags on dashboard:\n  • Fragility class     F in {1..5}\n  • Payload weight class W in {1..3}\n  • Delivery urgency     U in {1..3}\n  • Priority level       P_lvl in {1..5};

:Compute raw objective scores:\n  r_raw = F x 2   (fragility -> risk weight)\n  d_raw = U x 3   (urgency  -> distance weight)\n  e_raw = W x 2   (weight   -> energy weight)\n  total = r_raw + d_raw + e_raw;

:Normalise to routing objective weights:\n  w_risk   = r_raw / total\n  w_dist   = d_raw / total\n  w_energy = e_raw / total;

note right
  These weights form the
  ALGEBRAIC BRIDGE between
  payload metadata (Tier 2)
  and routing objectives (Tier 1).
end note

:Load pre-computed Pareto front P\nfrom Tier 1 storage (no re-planning needed);

:Min-max normalise Pareto objectives:\nFor each point p_i = (d_i, e_i, r_i):\n  dN_i = (d_i - d_min) / (d_max - d_min)\n  eN_i = (e_i - e_min) / (e_max - e_min)\n  rN_i = (r_i - r_min) / (r_max - r_min);

:Compute utility score for EVERY Pareto point:\nscore(p_i) = w_dist x (1 - dN_i)\n           + w_energy x (1 - eN_i)\n           + w_risk x (1 - rN_i);

if (Priority P_lvl >= 4\n(HIGH-priority mission)?) then (YES)
  :Amplify dominant weight:\nw_max = max(w_dist, w_energy, w_risk)\nscore += 0.1 x w_max;
else (NO)
endif

:Select mission route:\np* = argmax score(p_i)  over all p_i in P;

note right
  p* is a NON-EXTREME point
  for mixed-priority payloads.
  Only extreme payloads
  (e.g. pure urgency) pick
  the front endpoint.
end note

:Generate ArduPilot-compatible\nmission file (.waypoints);

:Upload mission to Pixhawk\nvia MAVLink protocol;

stop
@enduml
